end
end
fn rbit r ulong to bool
ret ne and get rwork div r 64 shl ulong 1 rem r 64 0
end
fn rset r ulong to void
k = div r 64
put rwork k or get rwork k shl ulong 1 rem r 64
end
fn rtrans b ulong verify bool to void
